    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n18697" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀχθ-εινός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ή</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄχθος</span>)
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>burdensome,
			oppressive,</i> of persons, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Hipp.</u>
				94
			</span></i>; of things, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Hec.</u>
				1240
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ-ότατον τοῦ βίου</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>Mem.</u>
					4.8.1
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βοοκτασία,</span> i.e. <i>that
				cost</i> the slayer <i>dear,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				AP
				6.263
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				Leon.
			</span></i>). Adv.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-νῶς</span>
			<i>unwillingly,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὐκ ἀ. ὁρᾶν τι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>HG</u>
					4.8.27
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>laborious,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βόες</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>IG</u>
					14.2012.16
				</span></i>
			 (Sulp. <i><span class="en">
				Max.
			</span></i>).</div>
